  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Administrer ubesværet din restaurant menu med Dash SaaS. ",
