  "Buy Now": "Køb nu",
  "View Live Demo": "Se Live Demo",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Dynamiske tilbud og kampagner",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Boost dit salg og tiltræk flere kunder med vores tilbudsstyringsfunktion. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Effektive bordopstillinger",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Optimer din spiseplads og strømline dine operationer med vores bordopstillingsfunktion. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Tilpasning og opdateringer i realtid",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Skræddersy din menu, så den passer til din restaurant unikke identitet med vores værktøjer til oprettelse af egenskaber og kategorier. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Forbedret kundeengagement",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Tag din kundeservice til næste niveau med vores kundestyringsværktøjer. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Frontend-opdateringer i realtid",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Med Dash SaaS er alle ændringer, du foretager i din menu, tilbud eller spisebordsarrangementer, øjeblikkeligt synlige på forsiden. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Hvorfor vælge dedikerede moduler",
  "for your business?": "for din virksomhed?",
